<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>宇树科技 on 刘贵泷的个人网页</title><link>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/tags/%E5%AE%87%E6%A0%91%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/</link><description>Recent content in 宇树科技 on 刘贵泷的个人网页</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Guilong Liu</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/tags/%E5%AE%87%E6%A0%91%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>宇树开源项目导读与 Python SDK 入门</title><link>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/p/unitree-open-source-sdk/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/p/unitree-open-source-sdk/</guid><description>&lt;p>本文整理原笔记涉及的仓库和 Python SDK 示例。仓库支持范围会随版本变化，名称后的 &lt;code>-main&lt;/code>、&lt;code>-master&lt;/code> 通常来自下载压缩包后的文件夹名，不是 Python 包名。请同时记录所用提交号。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="开源仓库按用途分类">开源仓库按用途分类
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>本文主要围绕 Go2 与 G1 学习。先按要解决的问题选择仓库，再阅读目标型号的示例。&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
&lt;thead>
&lt;tr>
&lt;th>用途&lt;/th>
&lt;th>原笔记涉及的仓库&lt;/th>
&lt;th>阅读重点&lt;/th>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/thead>
&lt;tbody>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>控制算法学习&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>unitree_guide&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>建模、关节控制与足式机器人控制&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>模仿学习&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>unitree_IL_lerobot&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>数据、策略与硬件接口的连接&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>MuJoCo 仿真&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>unitree_mujoco&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>模型、仿真循环与 SDK 通信&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>强化学习&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>unitree_rl_gym&lt;/code>、&lt;code>unitree_rl_lab&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>训练环境、观测、动作与策略部署&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>ROS 接入&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>unitree_ros&lt;/code>、&lt;code>unitree_ros2&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>区分 ROS 版本、模型描述与通信接口&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>C++ / Python 通信&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>unitree_sdk2&lt;/code>、&lt;code>unitree_sdk2_python&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>消息、客户端、状态与控制示例&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;tr>
&lt;td>相机接口&lt;/td>
&lt;td>&lt;code>UnitreecameraSDK&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
&lt;td>对照支持的设备型号，不直接套用到其他机器人&lt;/td>
&lt;/tr>
&lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>机器人型号、固件和仓库版本共同决定接口能否使用。仓库名称相近，不意味着脚本可以互换。与 G1 仿真有关的场景和导航内容可从 &lt;a class="link" href="https://Guilong-gitlab.github.io/guide/" >阅读导航&lt;/a> 继续。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="python-sdk-安装与示例阅读">Python SDK 安装与示例阅读
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="安装">安装
&lt;/h3>&lt;h4 id="原笔记使用的依赖">原笔记使用的依赖
&lt;/h4>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>python&amp;gt;=3.8&lt;/li>
&lt;li>cyclonedds==0.10.2&lt;/li>
&lt;li>numpy&lt;/li>
&lt;li>opencv-python&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h4 id="原笔记-python-版本">原笔记 Python 版本
&lt;/h4>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>python == 3.8&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h4 id="安装-unitree_sdk2_python">安装 unitree_sdk2_python
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>在终端中执行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">7
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>cd ~
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>sudo apt install python3-pip python3-venv
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>git clone https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_sdk2_python.git
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>cd unitree_sdk2_python
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python3 -m venv .venv
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>source .venv/bin/activate
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python -m pip install -e .
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h4 id="faq">FAQ
&lt;/h4>&lt;h5 id="找不到-cyclone-dds">找不到 Cyclone DDS
&lt;/h5>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Could not locate cyclonedds. Try to set CYCLONEDDS_HOME or CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>该错误提示找不到 cyclonedds 路径。首先编译安装cyclonedds：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">5
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>cd ~
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>git clone https://github.com/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds -b releases/0.10.x
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>cd cyclonedds &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> mkdir build install &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> cd build
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>cmake .. -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX&lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span>../install
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>cmake --build . --target install
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>进入 unitree_sdk2_python 目录，设置 &lt;code>CYCLONEDDS_HOME&lt;/code> 为刚刚编译好的 cyclonedds 所在路径，再安装 unitree_sdk2_python&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>cd ~/unitree_sdk2_python
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>source .venv/bin/activate
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>export CYCLONEDDS_HOME&lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>$HOME&lt;span style="color:#e6db74">/cyclonedds/install&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python -m pip install -e .
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>详细见：
&lt;a class="link" href="https://pypi.org/project/cyclonedds/#installing-with-pre-built-binaries" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>https://pypi.org/project/cyclonedds/#installing-with-pre-built-binaries&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="使用">使用
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>以下示例路径来自原笔记版本，运行前先检查当前仓库 &lt;code>example/&lt;/code> 的实际结构与型号目录。每个新终端都应进入 SDK 根目录并激活 &lt;code>.venv&lt;/code>。部分控制、避障与灯光示例面向四足机器人，不是 G1 的通用功能。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>python sdk2 接口与 unitree_sdk2的接口保持一致，通过请求响应或订阅发布topic实现机器人的状态获取和控制。相应的例程位于&lt;code>/example&lt;/code>目录下。在运行例程前，需要根据文档 &lt;a class="link" href="https://support.unitree.com/home/zh/developer/Quick_start" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>https://support.unitree.com/home/zh/developer/Quick_start&lt;/a> 配置好机器人的网络连接。&lt;/p>
&lt;h4 id="dds通讯">DDS通讯
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>在终端中执行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python3 ./example/helloworld/publisher.py
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>打开新的终端，执行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python3 ./example/helloworld/subscriber.py
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>可以看到终端输出的数据信息。&lt;code>publisher.py&lt;/code> 和 &lt;code>subscriber.py&lt;/code> 传输的数据定义在 &lt;code>user_data.py&lt;/code> 中，用户可以根据需要自行定义需要传输的数据结构。&lt;/p>
&lt;h4 id="高层状态和控制">高层状态和控制
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>高层接口的数据结构和控制方式与unitree_sdk2一致。具体可见：https://support.unitree.com/home/zh/developer/sports_services&lt;/p>
&lt;h5 id="高层状态">高层状态
&lt;/h5>&lt;p>终端中执行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python3 ./example/high_level/read_highstate.py enp2s0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>其中 &lt;code>enp2s0&lt;/code> 为机器人所连接的网卡名称，请根据实际情况修改。&lt;/p>
&lt;h5 id="高层控制">高层控制
&lt;/h5>&lt;p>终端中执行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>python3 ./example/high_level/sportmode_test.py enp2s0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>其中 &lt;code>enp2s0&lt;/code> 为机器人所连接的网卡名称，请根据实际情况修改。
该例程提供了几种测试方法，可根据测试需要选择:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#7f7f7f">5
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e"># test.StandUpDown() # 站立趴下&lt;/span>
